Subject: Add narayana, agroal, and camel-management to BOMs for 4.22

Upstream 4.22 removed narayana-spring-boot and agroal starters from the
auto-generated BOMs. These are still required downstream for the examples
and SAP quickstarts. Backport the entries from 4.21 (commit 4acaf788a75).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
